```mermaid
erDiagram
  profiles ||--o{ technician_categories : "訂閱"
  categories ||--o{ technician_categories : "被訂閱"
  categories ||--o{ tickets : "分類"
  buildings ||--o{ spaces : "包含"
  spaces ||--o{ equipment : "安裝於"
  spaces |o--o{ tickets : "所在空間"
  buildings |o--o{ tickets : "所在地點"
  equipment |o--o{ tickets : "相關設備"
  profiles |o--o{ tickets : "受指派"
  tickets ||--o{ ticket_photos : "佐證照片"
  tickets ||--o{ ticket_notes : "記事與狀態流轉"
  tickets ||--o{ notification_log : "派送帳務"
  tickets ||--o{ notifications : "站內通知"
  profiles ||--o{ notifications : "接收"
  profiles |o--o{ ticket_notes : "作者"
  profiles ||--o{ announcements : "發布"

  profiles {
    uuid id PK
    user_role user_role
    text display_name
    text department
    text phone
    bool is_active
  }
  categories {
    uuid id PK
    text name
    int sort_order
    bool is_active
  }
  technician_categories {
    uuid technician_id PK_FK
    uuid category_id PK_FK
  }
  buildings {
    uuid id PK
    text name
    text code
    int sort_order
  }
  spaces {
    uuid id PK
    text name
    int floor
    int sort_order
    uuid building_id FK
  }
  equipment {
    uuid id PK
    text name
    text code
    date purchase_date
    date warranty_expiry
    uuid space_id FK
  }
  tickets {
    uuid id PK
    ticket_status status
    uuid category_id FK
    uuid space_id FK_NULL
    uuid building_id FK_NULL
    uuid equipment_id FK_NULL
    uuid assigned_to FK_NULL
    text description
    text reporter_email
    text ticket_number GENERATED
    smallint rating
    timestamptz notification_ready_at
  }
  ticket_photos {
    uuid id PK
    uuid ticket_id FK
    ticket_photo_phase phase
    text storage_path
  }
  ticket_notes {
    uuid id PK
    uuid ticket_id FK
    uuid author_id FK_NULL
    ticket_note_type type
    text content
  }
  notification_log {
    uuid id PK
    uuid ticket_id FK
    text event_type
    text recipient_email
    text status
    int attempt_count
    timestamptz next_attempt_at
    timestamptz sent_at
    text resend_message_id
    text last_error
  }
  notifications {
    uuid id PK
    uuid recipient_id FK
    uuid ticket_id FK
    text event_type
    bool is_read
  }
  announcements {
    uuid id PK
    text title
    announcement_audience audience
    announcement_category category
    bool is_pinned
    uuid author_id FK
  }
```

權威來源：本檔列出全部 12 張表；`data-model.svg` 是領域總覽（8 實體，Diagram Design 的 ER 上限），
`data-model-detail.svg` 是工單記事、通知帳務與公告的明細。

未畫出的共用欄位：`created_at` / `updated_at`（各表皆有）、`tickets.reporter_name`、
`reporter_department`、`reporter_phone`、`equipment_name`、`rated_at`，以及 `notification_log.event_key`
（去重鍵）與 `tickets.ticket_number`（由 `id` 產生的 stored 欄位）。
`spaces` 另有 `UNIQUE(building_id, name, floor)`，`equipment.code`、`buildings.code`、
`buildings.name`、`categories.name` 皆為 unique。

`profiles.id` 另外參照 `auth.users.id`（跨 schema，`ON DELETE CASCADE`），本圖省略該外部邊界。
